{
  "_notes": [
    "Template. bind-project copies this to .claude/settings.json and strips every",
    "key whose name starts with '_' (JSON has no comments). If a settings.json",
    "already exists, merge instead of overwriting.",
    "",
    "includeCoAuthoredBy:false + empty attribution: no Co-Authored-By trailer and no",
    "'Generated with' line in commits or PR bodies. This is the enforcement; the",
    "prose in .claude/rules/git.md is only the reminder for hand-typed messages.",
    "",
    "PostToolUse hook: formats the single file just edited, per package. Never",
    "blocks — a formatter problem must not stop work.",
    "",
    "Stop hook: one batched `tsc --noEmit` per tsconfig covering the files changed",
    "in this session, at the end of the response instead of after every edit. It is",
    "a report, not a gate: it always exits 0 and never blocks. Remove the Stop entry",
    "on a repo with no TypeScript, or on one where a full typecheck is slow enough",
    "to be annoying — the root `verify` script is still the real gate.",
    "",
    "permissions: keep production-affecting commands OUT of `allow`. Deploys,",
    "destructive database commands, `git push --force`, secret reads and",
    "infrastructure CLIs (railway, fly, vercel --prod, kubectl, terraform apply, aws)",
    "belong in `ask` or `deny`, never in `allow`, and never in settings.local.json",
    "either — 'it asked me every time' is not a reason to hand over the deploy key.",
    "Fill `allow` with read-only and cheap local commands only.",
    "",
    "Replace <pm> below with the detected package manager (pnpm / npm / yarn / bun)."
  ],

  "includeCoAuthoredBy": false,
  "attribution": {},

  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(<pm> verify)",
      "Bash(<pm> typecheck:*)",
      "Bash(<pm> lint:*)",
      "Bash(<pm> test:*)",
      "Bash(git status:*)",
      "Bash(git diff:*)",
      "Bash(git log:*)"
    ],
    "ask": [
      "Bash(git push:*)",
      "Bash(<pm> publish:*)",
      "Bash(docker:*)"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "Read(./.env)",
      "Read(./.env.*)",
      "Read(./**/*.pem)",
      "Bash(git push --force:*)",
      "Bash(git commit --no-verify:*)"
    ]
  },

  "hooks": {
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/format.mjs\"",
            "timeout": 30
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/stop-typecheck.mjs\"",
            "timeout": 180
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
